# Runtime data: the SQLite database is created at runtime, never committed.
.agent/data/
node_modules/
# Local diagnostics may write an artifact bundle here; CI produces its own.
.agent/artifact/
# Local gate runs write their observation file here. It is NOT Evidence (only the
# trusted CI verification job produces that) and CI uploads its own copy as a run
# artifact, so the local file is never a tracked deliverable.
.agent/evidence/
